{"ID":"20260903125257-odu123y","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-odu123y","title":"日志清理与蓝盾包版本更新秋招面试准备笔记","type":"doc","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-zmooqkh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-zmooqkh","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理与蓝盾包版本更新 秋招面试准备笔记"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-bpejy60","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-bpejy60","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e "},{"ID":"20260903125257-e09rx6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-e09rx6r","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用范围：企业微信 Windows 端的两个需求 —— ① 壳进程（SmartRobot）日志系统改造（7 天自动清理 + 异步化 + Critical 独立文件下线）；② 蓝盾包新版本自动提醒（定时检测 + 静默下载 + 24h 节流弹窗）。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-kixxtlu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-kixxtlu","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本笔记参考 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"笔试面试.md"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的项目组织方式，按模块整理秋招面试问答。每个问题都是口语化、可直接口述的满分回答，全部围绕真实源码与设计文档（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"common/common/log.h/.cpp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"common/common/shell_status.h/.cpp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"new_version_reminder_src/interval_pipeline_silent_update_task.h/.cpp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"new_version_reminder_src/upgrade_utils.cpp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、《壳进程日志 7 天自动清理技术方案》、《【研效】新版本提醒技术方案 tech-spec.md》与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"overview.md"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"）展开，不引入项目外能力。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-06eqren","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-06eqren","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-9hi0if1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9hi0if1","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 1：整体背景与架构"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-wdnbnna","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-wdnbnna","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壳进程（SmartRobot）是做什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-p6u2mn6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-p6u2mn6","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壳进程是企业微信机器人的 Windows 宿主程序，可执行文件叫 SmartRobot.exe。它的核心职责是承载机器人（robot.exe）的完整生命周期：负责首次部署的扫码绑定（Bootstrap）、拉起 robot.exe、建立长连接、维护运行状态，以及给运维提供 Debug 窗口观察当前运行阶段和日志。它本身不做业务，是一个\"壳\"，所以叫壳进程。日志系统、运行阶段管理、退出码这些公共能力都放在 common 目录里。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-qk5isnn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-qk5isnn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个需求分别在什么背景下提出的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-f9ozwrz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-f9ozwrz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理需求是因为壳进程跟随企微按需启动，用户可能连续多天不启动，旧的按天日志文件会一直堆积在磁盘上；原来的日志系统只靠 spdlog 的 max_files 做数量兜底，无法覆盖\"断续启动\"场景，所以要改成\"按日期严格保留最近 7 天\"，同时把日志写入异步化，避免磁盘 IO 拖慢启动。蓝盾包版本更新需求是因为蓝盾流水线包没有自动升级通道，开发同学手上的内部包版本长期滞后，影响研发效率，所以要给蓝盾包补一条低打扰的自动更新提醒通道。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-k5lpj15","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-k5lpj15","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这两个需求用到的技术栈是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-k50ua3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-k50ua3c","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"都是 C++（C++17）+ Windows 平台。日志系统用的是 spdlog 这个 C++ 日志库，具体是 daily_file_sink 按天滚动、dist_sink 多路分发、async_logger 异步写、msvc_sink 输出到 DebugView；文件系统操作用 std::filesystem 和 boost::filesystem；版本更新那边用的是企微自研的 IntervalTask 周期任务框架、Promise 异步回调、NotifyCenter 通知中心、CheckUpdateService 检查更新服务。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-umh67bn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-umh67bn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志系统的整体架构是怎样的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-b4c475u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-b4c475u","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志系统以 InitLog 为入口，一次初始化三件事：起一个后台清理线程扫盘删过期日志，初始化 spdlog 的异步线程池，创建主 logger。主 logger 用 dist_sink 同时抄送两个出口：daily_file_sink 写磁盘（按天滚动、保留 7 天）、msvc_sink 输出到 DebugView。每条日志通过 LogEntry 这个 RAII 临时对象承载，析构时 flush 到底层 logger，同时同步推送给 ShellStatusHub 供 Debug 窗口展示。整体是\"业务代码零感知的异步化 + 双层清理 + 状态透出\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-k59m9z5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-k59m9z5","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一条日志从写入到落盘的完整链路是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-53f96xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-53f96xb","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"业务代码写 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WCRS_LOG_INFO() \u0026lt;\u0026lt; \"hello\""},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，宏展开成一个 LogEntry 临时对象，通过 operator\u003c\u003c 把内容塞进内部的 ostringstream。LogEntry 析构时，先拼上\"文件名:行号\"前缀，然后调 g_logger-\u003elog()。因为 g_logger 是 async_logger，这一句只是把消息拷贝进线程池队列就立即返回，真正的格式化展开和写盘由 spdlog 后台线程完成。后台线程遍历 dist_sink，把内容同时写进 daily_file_sink（磁盘）和 msvc_sink（DebugView）。最后 LogEntry 析构还会把这条日志同步 push 给 ShellStatusHub，让 Debug 窗口实时看到。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-8zfxub1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-8zfxub1","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么日志系统要设计成 LogEntry 的 RAII 临时对象？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-c8i1ugl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-c8i1ugl","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为这样可以让\"打日志\"和\"flush 日志\"自动配对。业务代码用完 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"WCRS_LOG_INFO() \u0026lt;\u0026lt; ..."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这个完整表达式，临时对象就自动析构，析构函数里完成真正的工作：拼前缀、写 logger、推 Hub。好处是业务侧不用手动 flush，也不会有\"忘了 flush\"的 bug；而且 LogEntry 构造时先判断级别，低于阈值的调用直接不分配 stream，把开销降到最低。这个模式和主工程的 base::LogEntry 语义一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-2rrfbsj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-2rrfbsj","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-6vcgyjt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-6vcgyjt","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 2：日志系统设计与 7 天清理"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ao76gwr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ao76gwr","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么单靠 spdlog 的 max_files 不够？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-j9yxv69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-j9yxv69","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 spdlog daily_file_sink 的 max_files=N 语义是\"最多保留 N 个历史 daily 文件\"，清理动作发生在跨天 rotate 时，判据是文件数量而不是文件日期。在\"每天都启动壳\"的假设下 max_files=7 约等于\"保留 7 天\"，但壳进程跟随企微按需启动，用户可能连续多日不启动。比如 8 月 1 日有一条日志，8 月 2 到 9 日完全没启动，8 月 10 日首次启动时磁盘上只有 shell_2026-08-01.log 一个文件，rotate 后历史文件数 = 1 \u003c 7，不删，这个已超 7 天的文件就一直滞留。所以 max_files 只是数量兜底，必须再加一层按日期删过期。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-6hpomd8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-6hpomd8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双层清理是怎么设计的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-zaotj1y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-zaotj1y","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一层是 spdlog 自带的 max_files=7，运行期数量兜底，防止极端连续写入导致磁盘爆炸，触发时机是跨天 rotate，由 spdlog 后台线程执行。第二层是新增的 TrimOldMainLogs 函数，启动时扫 LogDir 根目录（非递归），按文件名解析日期，超过 7 天就 remove，专门覆盖\"用户断续启动、长期不启动\"的场景。两层各司其职：一层管数量、一层管日期。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-s9ywy2n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-s9ywy2n","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TrimOldMainLogs 是怎么按日期删文件的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-j2mbpsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-j2mbpsh","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它启动时遍历 LogDir 根目录，对每个文件用正则 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"shell_(\\d{4})-(\\d{2})-(\\d{2})\\.log"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解析文件名里的日期段，解析成功就转成 time_t 和阈值比较，小于阈值（早于\"今天零点减 7 天\"）就 fs::remove 删除。解析失败的文件一律保留，保护用户手放的其它文件和旧版本残留的未知格式文件。整个函数用 error_code 版本的文件 API，单个文件删除失败只计数不抛，最外层还有 try/catch 兜底，保证清理不会阻塞启动。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hffkpzo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hffkpzo","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么判据用文件名日期而不是 last_write_time？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-56ssyxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-56ssyxa","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为壳 App 磁盘上的主日志文件名是 shell_YYYY-MM-DD.log，文件名后缀日期就是文件的生成日期，语义直白。last_write_time 会受到\"当天日志追加写入\"的影响，而且可能被 touch、拷贝保留 mtime、时区等外部因素干扰。文件名日期没有这些外部依赖，最经得起推敲。做法就是直接读文件名里的日期段用正则解析，和\"今天零点减 7 天\"比较。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-jji7af7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-jji7af7","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么阈值要归零到当天 00:00？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-a77e0t6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-a77e0t6","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 TryParseMainLogDate 解析出的 file_t 是当天零点的时间戳（文件名里只有年月日，没有时分秒），如果 now 不归零，直接拿\"当前时刻减 7 天\"和 file_t 比较，就会有时分秒的错位，导致恰好 7 天前的那份文件被误删或误留。把 now 归零到当天 00:00 再减 7 天，两者就同量纲了，边界日的判断才准确。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-rpg71ry","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-rpg71ry","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么清理时机放在进程启动而不是退出？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-1jvde7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-1jvde7n","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为用户\"一开壳就期望旧文件消失\"，启动瞬间语义最强。而且进程被强杀、机器断电时，退出清理函数根本不会执行，启动是必然触发点。还有一个技术原因：此刻 spdlog 还没创建 sink、没打开任何 daily 文件，remove 不会有句柄冲突。这和主工程\"先释放句柄再删文件\"的时序一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-jvudgmf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-jvudgmf","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 Critical 独立文件要下线？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lnql6hn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lnql6hn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原来的设计是 Critical 级别的日志额外写一份到 critical 子目录的独立文件，不轮转、永久追加，保证崩溃瞬间的关键日志不丢。但需求收缩后，决定只保留主日志一条产出线路，Critical 独立文件不再产出。原因是它增加了维护成本和磁盘占用，而 Critical 内容其实已经通过主 logger 完整落盘了，独立文件只是\"多一份冗余副本\"，不是\"唯一载体\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-kjkz7d3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-kjkz7d3","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Critical 内容怎么保证不丢？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-by7mll7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-by7mll7","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 LogEntry 析构里，每条日志都是无条件先写主 logger（g_logger-\u003elog(...)），Critical 是 spdlog 最高级别，必然通过主 logger 的级别过滤，所以每条 Critical 日志都会落到主日志。下线前后对比：下线前 Critical 日志分布 = 主日志 + shell_critical.log，下线后 = 主日志，是\"减少一份冗余副本\"，不是\"信息丢失\"。级别标签 [C] 由 pattern 的 %L 输出，事后可以用 findstr \"[C]\" 快速筛出关键事件。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-s3zht4v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-s3zht4v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保留枚举但删除独立 sink 为什么是安全的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-py35f0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-py35f0q","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 LogLevel::Critical 这个枚举承担两种独立职责：一是\"重要事件\"的语义标签，由 pattern %L 输出 [C]；二是\"是否额外写一个文件\"的开关。这两种职责本来就该正交。删除的是职责二对应的实现代码（Critical sink 和双写分支），职责一完整保留。业务侧 21 处 WCRS_LOG_CRITICAL() 调用无感知——它们只关心\"这条日志被标记为最高优先级\"，至于是否落到独立文件是内部实现细节。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-e6w1z9v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-e6w1z9v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理线程怎么管理生命周期？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-bx8xzx2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-bx8xzx2","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用一个匿名命名空间的全局 std::thread g_trim_thread 承载清理。InitLog 首步用 std::thread(lambda) 起后台线程执行 TrimOldMainLogs，主线程不等待，立即继续初始化线程池和 sink。ShutdownLog 里在 spdlog::shutdown() 之前 join 这个线程，保证正常退出时等待清理完成。如果起线程失败（std::system_error，资源耗尽），就在内层 catch 里降级为同步执行，保证清理不跳过。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lsg4b5v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lsg4b5v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理线程与 spdlog 写盘怎么做到并发安全？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lpnpisq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lpnpisq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键是不变量：TrimOldMainLogs 只删除\"文件名日期 \u003e 7 天前\"的文件，而 spdlog 稍后打开/写入的是\"今天\"的文件，两者的操作集合天然不相交，所以无需加锁。极端场景下如果清理线程和 spdlog 的 max_files=7 淘汰同时对同一个文件调 remove，fs::remove 的 error_code 版本只会把失败计入 failed++，不抛不崩。另外 TrimOldMainLogs 内部只调 FallbackOutput（OutputDebugStringW），不调任何 WCRS_LOG_* 或 spdlog logger，彻底避免了清理线程到日志队列的反向依赖。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-j3ulspt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-j3ulspt","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-ljco4hk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ljco4hk","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 3：日志异步化与并发安全"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hh27t9f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hh27t9f","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么日志要异步化？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hlnntsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hlnntsd","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为同步 logger 是\"一杆到底\"的：业务线程从级别过滤、格式化、到遍历 sink 写磁盘，整个调用栈延伸到 WriteFile 系统调用，中间没有线程切换。磁盘慢业务就慢，一次 fsync 卡几十毫秒，业务线程就得跟着等。异步化把\"格式化\"和\"写磁盘\"拆开：业务线程只把消息塞进线程池队列就立即返回，真正写盘交给后台 worker。业务线程的耗时从毫秒级降到微秒级，基本感知不到打日志的开销。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ptzqzu0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ptzqzu0","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"async_logger 的底层原理是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ppwnxep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ppwnxep","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"async_logger 继承 logger，但只 override 了 sink_it_ 这一个虚函数。业务代码调 logger-\u003einfo() 时，前半段（级别过滤、格式化拼字符串）完全复用父类逻辑，到 sink_it_ 这一步被 override 了——不再遍历 sink 写盘，而是把消息完整拷贝一份塞进线程池队列就返回。队列元素是 async_msg，里面把日志内容完整拷贝了一份，避免业务线程的临时对象在 worker 处理时已经析构。这个设计让业务代码完全不知道它用的是同步还是异步 logger，可以运行时切换。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-c9ohq4v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-c9ohq4v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"block 溢出策略是怎么工作的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-h8i0a38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-h8i0a38","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"spdlog 的异步队列是一个有界阻塞队列，配了 mutex 和两个 condition_variable。队列满时按选定的溢出策略处理。block 策略是：enqueue 时如果队列满，业务线程在 condition_variable::wait 上阻塞，等 worker pop 一条消息后 notify 唤醒再 push。所以 block 策略下磁盘写多慢，业务线程就等多慢，但保证不丢日志。另外两个策略 overrun_oldest 丢最老消息、discard_new 丢新消息，都会丢日志，不适用于壳 App 这种密度低的场景。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-gb6oob7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-gb6oob7","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"flush_on(warn) 在异步下是什么语义？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-htu0n0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-htu0n0q","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"同步下 flush_on(warn) 是\"Warn 及以上级别每条立即刷盘\"。异步下降级为\"往队列塞一个 flush 标记\"，不保证逐条立即落盘、不保证强杀不丢，唯一实际收益是让 Warn+ 日志的落盘延迟从\"由 periodic_flush 或 OS 缓存刷新决定\"降为\"入队即触发后台 flush\"，几毫秒级差异。壳 App 没有 periodic_flush 设置，保留这一条能让关键日志落盘更快一点。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-m91l5k0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-m91l5k0","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强杀丢日志这个降级是怎么权衡的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-31dn01s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-31dn01s","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步化必然带来一个代价：进程被强杀或断电时，队列里还没落盘的日志会丢失，包括 Warn/Error/Critical。这个降级是明确接受了的，理由是壳 App 日志密度很低（\u003c10 条/秒），实际丢失窗口通常在几毫秒内；而且 flush_on(warn) 让关键日志更快落盘，进一步缩小窗口。权衡原则是\"宁可强杀时丢几毫秒的日志，也不要让业务线程每次打日志都卡在磁盘 IO 上\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-q7gxgmo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-q7gxgmo","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ShutdownLog 的清理链是什么顺序？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-e3k4rm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-e3k4rm8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"顺序是：先 g_logger-\u003eflush()（异步队列塞 flush 标记）→ g_logger.reset()（解除本地引用，但队列消息里还有 shared_ptr）→ g_trim_thread.join()（等清理线程完成）→ spdlog::shutdown()（join 后台线程 + 排空异步队列）。这个顺序保证：清理线程先回收，再让 spdlog 排空队列，最后才结束。join 清理线程放在 spdlog::shutdown 之前，是为了让\"清理\"和\"日志排空\"两个异步动作都完整结束。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-0tnq22l","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-0tnq22l","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 g_trim_thread 这个静态 std::thread 是规范的例外？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-p6inhm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-p6inhm7","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目规范禁止\"具有静态存储期的非平凡析构对象\"，因为 std::thread 静态析构时如果还 joinable 会调 std::terminate 直接杀进程。但这里引入了匿名命名空间的全局 std::thread g_trim_thread，严格说触发了这条。规避方式是：ShutdownLog 里 join 保证静态析构前 joinable()==false，而 ShutdownLog 在 main.cpp 两条正常退出路径上都已被调用。所以正常场景不变式恒成立。异常路径（abort/_exit/未捕获异常）下进程已经在非常态终止流程，terminate 的额外损害可忽略。这个例外是显式声明并论证过的。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-li7ilsx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-li7ilsx","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"起线程失败为什么要在内层 catch 降级而不是外层？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-jvrli7w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-jvrli7w","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为外层 try/catch(std::exception) 的语义是\"日志系统初始化失败\"，catch 里会 g_logger.reset() 进入 fallback 分支（只输出 DebugView，不写文件）。如果把\"起清理线程失败\"也丢给外层 catch，就会误判成\"日志系统初始化失败\"，导致主日志文件也不写了，这是两个不同严重程度的问题。所以起线程失败单独用内层 try/catch(std::system_error) 捕获，catch 里同步执行 TrimOldMainLogs，保证清理不跳过，同时主日志照常初始化。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tkaw8v8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tkaw8v8","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-45d99pf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-45d99pf","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 4：ShellStatusHub 与日志联动"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-jw1bzv1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-jw1bzv1","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ShellStatusHub 是干什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-314evua","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-314evua","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它是壳进程内部的一个单例，收集运行阶段（ShellStage）和事件 ring buffer，Debug 窗口据此渲染。阶段记录\"进程现在处于什么阶段\"（比如 Bootstrap 扫码、Robot 拉起、长连接认证），事件是每条 Info/Warn/Error/Critical 日志的镜像。Debug 窗口不是 always-on 的，所以先让事件累积在 ring buffer 里，等窗口打开时一次性灌回历史。它完全内部加锁，任意线程可调用。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-x791hnv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-x791hnv","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么日志要同步 push 到 ShellStatusHub？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-v177lgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-v177lgn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 LogEntry 是所有 WCRS_LOG_* 的最终 flush 点，在这里 push 可以让业务侧代码零改动就把关键信息透出到 Debug 窗口。业务代码只需要正常打日志，Debug 窗口就能实时看到，不用额外维护一套\"上报到窗口\"的通道。放在 LogEntry 析构里是因为这是每一条日志必经的唯一出口。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-c1t4bzl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-c1t4bzl","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"thread_local 重入保护是干什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-fhqi01r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-fhqi01r","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"LogEntry 析构里会调 ShellStatusHub::AppendEvent，而 AppendEvent 或 observer 回调路径中如果又触发了 WCRS_LOG_*，会导致新的 LogEntry 析构再次进入 AppendEvent，形成无限递归导致栈溢出。thread_local bool in_event_flush 加 RAII 守卫保证同一线程不会重入这条路径：进入时置 true，离开时用 FlushGuard 的析构置 false，异常安全。这就是\"日志系统里 push 状态，状态系统里又打日志\"这个环的解法。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5dxkrj2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5dxkrj2","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"SetObserver 的 in-flight 屏障是怎么保证生命周期安全的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lpaa0rp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lpaa0rp","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"observer 通知是跨线程的，DebugWindow 析构时如果还有回调在飞，就会访问已析构的对象。所以 SetObserver(nullptr) 有 barrier 语义：传 nullptr 取消注册时，阻塞直到所有\"已在途的 OnStageChanged/OnEventAppended 回调\"全部返回才 return。实现是：触发回调前在锁内 ++observer_in_flight_，释放锁执行回调，回调返回后重新加锁 --observer_in_flight_ 并 notify_all；SetObserver 在锁内等到 in_flight 归零才写指针返回。同时约束\"不得在回调内部调 SetObserver(nullptr)\"，否则自等死锁。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lolvxad","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lolvxad","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么 Debug 级事件在 Hub 侧被丢弃？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-0rpksbn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-0rpksbn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 Debug 级日志量大、噪声多，Debug 窗口主要展示\"发生了什么\"，不需要每一条调试细节。LogEntry 里把 Private/Debug 统一折成 ShellEventLevel::Debug，Hub 的 AppendEvent 里对 Debug 级直接 return 丢弃。这样减噪，让窗口只显示 Info/Warn/Error/Critical 这些有信息量的内容。如果需要看 Debug 级，业务侧可以提升级别。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-l4vhqh8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-l4vhqh8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FallbackOutput 兜底是干什么的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-7fdiun5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-7fdiun5","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它是日志系统的最后一道防线。spdlog 未初始化、初始化失败、或者目录没写权限时，g_logger 是空的，这时 LogEntry 析构走 if (!g_logger) 分支，调 FallbackOutput，通过 OutputDebugStringW 输出到 DebugView，保证日志至少能被调试器观察到。TrimOldMainLogs 内部也用它输出统计行，因为清理线程不该调 spdlog logger，只能用这个兜底输出。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-zr7y22m","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-zr7y22m","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-019f563","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-019f563","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 5：蓝盾包版本更新 - 需求与整体设计"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-6jh0yew","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-6jh0yew","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝盾包版本更新这个需求解决什么痛点？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-whwon8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-whwon8g","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝盾流水线包没有自动升级通道。正式包走系统配置 CGI 下发的建议/强制/静默升级链路，蓝盾包只能由使用者主动打开\"设置-关于-版本更新\"手动点击检查、下载、安装。结果是开发同学手上的内部包版本长期滞后，问题复现、自测、跟版验证都基于旧包，影响研发效率和问题定位准确性。这个需求给蓝盾包补一条低打扰的自动更新提醒通道：后台定时检测新版本 → 静默下载 → 下载完成弹窗询问是否安装，提醒频率受 24h 节流。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-dllq5yo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-dllq5yo","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用双闸门设计？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-rnpr5b3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-rnpr5b3","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双闸门是编译期 + 运行期两道防护。编译期用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RDM_BUILD 宏，所有新增代码和改动都包裹在宏里，非蓝盾包编译时预处理后代码与改动前逐字节相同，现网产物根本不含这些代码，风险为零。运行期再加一道 Debug 开关（默认关闭），即使蓝盾包也要手动打开开关才生效。这样即使编译期隔离有遗漏，运行期开关也能兜底，双保险保证现网零影响。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-v0toyl0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-v0toyl0","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5 个功能点分别是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hdbndrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hdbndrx","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"F1 是 Debug 开关，在升级相关 tab 下加一个\"蓝盾包新版本自动提醒\"开关，默认关闭，设备级持久化。F2 是定时检测，登录后注册周期任务，首检 2 秒、周期 24 小时，只对当前流水线发 CGI 3502 检测。F3 是静默下载，发现新版本后后台下载到独立包类别目录，全程无 UI。F4 是完成弹窗，Logic 发通知、UI 监听后复用 CLiveUpdateFrame 的下载完成态提示安装。F5 是节流与持久化，设备级持久化\"上次提醒时间\"，弹窗前校验 24 小时。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ec7xhjx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ec7xhjx","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么只比对当前流水线而不是多线检测？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tlcq88q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tlcq88q","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为静默下载加跨大版本跳线的风险叠加太高。当前流水线就是 PIPELINE_ID 指向的那一条，比对的是这条线最新成功构建的版本号。跨流水线升级（比如\"试试更新到 xx 线\"）继续走既有手动菜单，代码一行不动。这个决策还有三个实现推论：CGI 只填 pipeline_id 不带 version_number、只解析 verdata 不解析 new_verdata、跨线筛选的三个函数全部不需要，从而 config_window 零改动。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-9x7w96g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9x7w96g","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么用通知解耦而不是 logic 直接调 UI？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-kkg7eez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-kkg7eez","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 logic 层周期任务直接 include UI 头文件直调会形成层级倒置。正确做法是 logic 层只发通知（NotifyCenter-\u003ePostEvent），UI 层注册监听后自取主窗句柄弹窗。而且必须新增独立通知名，严禁复用既有的 kUpgradeNotification——它的处理函数在强制更新时会 Logout，复用会把手伸进现网升级链路。这套\"logic 发通知、UI 监听\"是现网建议升级的既有范式。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-dqjbptm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-dqjbptm","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么改动全部是\"加法\"而非改写既有逻辑？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lg36nmp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lg36nmp","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是需求方明确的原则（D11）：能复用就复用、不改变现有逻辑、不过度耦合。对现有文件只允许\"加法\"（新增数据项/默认参数/分支），不允许改写既有分支的执行路径。这样做的目的是让现网行为完全不变，风险收敛到最小。唯一在既有函数体内插入的是 LiveUpdateFrame 的 5 处宏内分支，宏未定义时预处理后逐字节不变。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5tk3oxq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5tk3oxq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么新增代码都落在 component 层而不是 UI 层？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-h47fryw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-h47fryw","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为路径能力（静默包落地路径、取最新、清理）Logic 和 UI 两侧都要用。Logic 层周期任务需要\"下载落地路径\"，UI 层安装函数需要\"取最新静默包\"。如果放 UI 层，Logic 就必须 include UI 头文件，正好是层级倒置。component/upgrade 是 UI 与 Logic 共同的下层依赖，而且本身就聚集了一批 GetXxxDirectoryPath()，是天然落点。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-gpgmyv6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-gpgmyv6","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-qqhyqcz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-qqhyqcz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 6：蓝盾包版本更新 - 周期任务核心实现"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tr90h9z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tr90h9z","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IntervalTask 周期任务是怎么设计的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-0hfojjl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-0hfojjl","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"新增 IntervalPipelineSilentUpdateTask 继承 IntervalTask 基类，构造时传编译期常量 kCheckIntervalSeconds（24 小时），然后 SetFirstIntervalTimeInSeconds(2) 设首检 2 秒。核心方法是 DoOnInterval，每轮先 CheckGate 校验闸门，不通过就 ScheduleNext 续期返回；通过就 CheckLatestVersion 发 CGI。整个流程是回调链：CGI 的 .then 里做版本比对决定是否下载，下载回调里做节流判定决定是否弹窗，每个 .then 首行判 IsAborted()。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ykjvsp7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ykjvsp7","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么构造参数必须用编译期常量？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-svdnkw9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-svdnkw9","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是一个 UB 陷阱。如果写成 IntervalTask(某成员函数())，这个函数调用发生在 IntervalTask 基类子对象构造之前，而 environment 存放在 ServiceTask::impl_ 里，impl_ 要到 ServiceTask 的构造函数里才 make_unique。此时 impl_ 是未初始化的 unique_ptr，GetEnvironment() 会解引用随机地址，属未定义行为：通常直接崩溃，侥幸不崩就得到垃圾 interval，可能触发基类的断言或静默失效。所以构造初值用编译期常量，Debug 配置延后到 DoOnInterval 运行时读。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-72yppvz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-72yppvz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么所有分支都走 ScheduleNext 而不是 FinishExecuting？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-1cikica","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-1cikica","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为子类如果调 FinishExecuting()，任务会永久结束、定时器不再续期。而开关默认关闭，这是必经路径而非边缘情况：启动首检时闸门不通过，如果调 FinishExecuting 任务就永久死亡，用户之后打开开关本次运行期永不生效。所以闸门未通过也走 ScheduleNext 按周期续期。这里要区分清楚：基类 NextInterval 里 IsAborted 分支内的 FinishExecuting 是框架必要收尾，严禁修改；要取消的是子类 DoOnInterval 里主动调 FinishExecuting 的写法。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-9qf2plz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9qf2plz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CGI 失败为什么必须用 onError 兜底续期？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-miw6tg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-miw6tg8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CheckDevopsUpdata().then(...) 只覆盖 resolve 路径。一旦 CGI 失败（断网、超时、后台异常），Promise 走 reject 路径，then handler 完全不触发，ScheduleNext 就不执行，定时器不再续期，功能静默失效直到重启。而且 CheckDevopsUpdata 内部已经 .onError 打了日志，这个 error handler 不会触达本任务的代码。所以必须在本任务里 .then(...).onError(...)，在 onError 里切回执行线程调 ScheduleNext。注意 err 是引用，PostTask 前要先取值，否则异步执行时悬空。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tqkf29z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tqkf29z","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"promise 版 CGI 为什么必须在 UI 线程发起？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-1xtos6i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-1xtos6i","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 promise 版 SendCGIRequest 带\"请在 UI 线程发起请求\"的注释和 assert(当前线程 == UI 线程)，而本任务运行在执行线程，Debug 构建下每轮检测都会命中断言。解法是照抄现网 IntervalAutoSilentUpgradeTask 的范式：先 GetUIThread()-\u003ePostTask 切到 UI 线程发 CGI，回调里再 GetExecuteThread()-\u003ePostTask 切回执行线程处理结果。这样断言前提成立，而且\"回调切回执行线程\"成为真正必要的一跳，避免跨线程操作 timer_。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-bbc07hq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-bbc07hq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么下载地址必须用固定模板？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-9mn2pec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9mn2pec","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 ParseDevopsUpdateVerDate 从 verdata 解出的 url 是蓝盾流水线详情页地址，不是安装包下载地址。如果直接拿它下载，会把一个 HTML 页面当安装包下载。自测实证：下载器报 file_size=142 实际收到 2048 字节的 HTML，触发 file_length \u003e file_size 防护主动中止。解法是按固定模板拼装 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"https://pkg.work.weixin.qq.com/wwdl/ossPkgDownload/download?pipeId=...\u0026amp;platform=pc"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，再追加 cst/vid/deviceid 鉴权参数。cst 是对目标 URL 的签名，必须基于最终下载 URL 计算。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hlv8ttj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hlv8ttj","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"24h 节流为什么只节流弹窗不节流检测和下载？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-jd25kb4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-jd25kb4","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为检测和下载是静默无打扰的，可以提前备好包；只有弹窗会打扰用户，所以只对弹窗设限。这样设计的好处是：包能提前下载好，等节流到期直接弹窗；而且节流状态持久化后，重启进程也拦不住重复弹窗。具体是检测/下载不受节流约束，弹窗前校验 last_notify_time + 24h \u003c= now，不满足就不弹但包保留。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-eum6bkr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-eum6bkr","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节流对齐（相位差问题）是怎么解决的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-8vooro8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-8vooro8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测周期和节流门槛是两个独立的 24 小时计时，起点不同，存在相位差。固定 24 小时续期时，最坏情况两次弹窗间隔接近 48 小时。比如 12 点弹窗，23 点检测到新版本但差 1 小时不弹，固定续期到次日 23 点才弹，间隔 47 小时。解法是 ScheduleNext 里如果\"节流剩余时间\"小于检测周期，就把下一轮提前到节流到期那一刻，让间隔精确等于 24 小时。必须配套：检测周期与节流门槛统一取同一个常量、加最小间隔保护防止对齐值过小。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-3bznmo5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-3bznmo5","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间戳为什么 PostEvent 后立即写？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-s96himn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-s96himn","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 PostEvent 是异步投递，调用返回时弹窗还没展示。三个备选方案权衡：用 SendEvent 同步——禁止，源码注释明确\"同步通知容易死锁\"；UI 弹窗成功后回写 config——破坏解耦还需新增反向通知；PostEvent 后立即写——唯一不一致窗口是\"投递后到 UI 处理消息前进程崩溃\"，间隔几毫秒，且误差方向安全：后果是少弹一次提醒，而非重复弹窗打扰。原则是\"宁可漏提醒，不可重复骚扰\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-3gisqhm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-3gisqhm","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"独立包类别为什么必须物理隔离？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-1fnh6mh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-1fnh6mh","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为现有的流水线包所有流水线共用同一个文件类别 PiplineUpdate.tmp，而且 GetMatchUpdatePackagePath 会删除同类别下名字不匹配的文件，ExecutePiplineUpdate 又按写入时间取最新、不校验流水线。如果静默下载沿用这个类别，会与手动跨线下载互删安装包、甚至装错版本导致静默降级。所以静默下载必须新增独立类别 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp，配套独立的路径/取最新/清理函数，两类文件对彼此的查询互不可见。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-2olmot8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-2olmot8","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么后缀命名要避开 Update.tmp 尾缀？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-sk5stog","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-sk5stog","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是自测暴露的坑。初版命名 PiplineSilentUpdate.tmp，末尾 ...SilentUpdate.tmp 恰好以 Update.tmp 结尾，会被 GetAllExistUpdatePackagePath(\"Update.tmp\") 的尾缀匹配误判成普通包，进而在每次启动的 ResetAllUpdateState 中被删。自测实测重启后 8 秒内包被删、首检重新下载。修复是把后缀改成 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp（Silent 移到 Update 之后），末尾变为 Silent.tmp，与 Update.tmp/PiplineUpdate.tmp 均无尾缀包含关系。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-qi8219i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-qi8219i","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么不动 ResetAllUpdateState？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-9xrdtxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9xrdtxq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CheckAndExecuteUpdate 在每次进程启动、登录之前被调用，其第一个分支对蓝盾包必然成立（GetUpdateVersion 为空，CompareVersion(current, \"\") 返回 1），即每次启动都会执行 ResetAllUpdateState 清空所有升级包。如果把静默包也加进这个清理，下载完成后用户点 X 不装，重启企微，包在登录前就被删掉，每轮重新下载，核心功能失效。所以 ResetAllUpdateState 一行不动，孤儿文件由周期任务自行清理：每轮检测发现本地静默包版本 \u003c= 当前运行版本（已安装或过期）时调 RemoveAllPiplineSilentUpdatePackages 删除。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-4awgagw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-4awgagw","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-kf4uosr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-kf4uosr","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 7：蓝盾包版本更新 - 弹窗与边界处理"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-wmqxp3j","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-wmqxp3j","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么复用 CLiveUpdateFrame 而不是新建弹窗？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-xhb928y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-xhb928y","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CLiveUpdateFrame 是既有的升级弹窗，\"下载完成\"态已经具备，安装按钮逻辑已具备。复用它零新增 XML、图片、文案。做法是 InitParam 加一个默认 false 的 package_ready 字段，InitWindow 加一个分支直接进\"下载完成\"态。这样静默提醒弹窗就是\"包已就绪，问你要不要装\"，和手动链路的下载完成态长一样，用户认知一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-vupx3hd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-vupx3hd","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么弹窗前要销毁已存在的旧弹窗？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-akwm282","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-akwm282","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 CLiveUpdateFrame 用 force_instance/suggest_instance 两个静态实例复用窗口，静默提醒落在 suggest_instance 槽位。既有代码在该槽位被占用时只把旧窗口置顶、不会用新的 init_param 重建。后果有两个：旧窗口来自手动检查更新时，本轮静默提醒完全弹不出来，而时间戳已写入，提醒直接丢失；旧窗口是上一轮静默提醒时，窗口显示旧版本号，形成\"显示 A、装 B\"的错位。所以弹窗前检测单例，被占用就销毁重建。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-gexnb7o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-gexnb7o","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么必须用 DestroyWindow 而不是 Close？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-3hkw4dy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-3hkw4dy","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 Close() 的实现是 PostMessage(WM_CLOSE)，异步的：函数返回前窗口还存在、suggest_instance 还非空，若沿用 is_exists 判断仍会走\"只置顶\"分支；若强行在 Close 后立即重建，稍后旧窗口的 WM_CLOSE 被处理时，其 OnFinalMessage 会把 suggest_instance 置空，把刚建好的新实例引用清掉。::DestroyWindow 同步派发 WM_DESTROY/WM_NCDESTROY，OnFinalMessage 在其返回前执行完毕，两个隐患同时消除。这个和 open_conversation_window 的单例销毁范式一致。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-kjf7scd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-kjf7scd","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么新增 ShowPiplineSilentUpdateWindow 封装？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-gykw3vh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-gykw3vh","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为既有 ui::ShowLiveUpdateWindow 的签名固定为 (parent, main_window_handle, upgrade_type, new_version, description, title, url)，无法传入 package_ready 这个新字段。而且 check_update_utils.h 对 CLiveUpdateFrame 只做了前向声明，wework_main_view.cpp 里看不到 InitParam 的定义，不新增封装就得让 wework_main_view 额外 include LiveUpdateFrame.h 并自行拼装 InitParam。封装在 check_update_utils 里更合适，它还和 ExecutePiplineSilentUpdate 成对出现。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-93dnno6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-93dnno6","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5 个控件可见性为什么缺一不可？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-s80emit","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-s80emit","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 InitDownLoadLayout 只设置版本号文本和部分控件的宽度，不做 SetVisible。真正切换到\"下载完成\"态的可见性操作分散在别处。新分支必须自己补齐 5 个控件：NewVersionLayout 隐藏（否则介绍页和下载完成内容叠加）、DownloadLayout 显示（否则弹窗空白）、downloading_layout 隐藏（否则残留进度条）、download_finish_layout 显示（否则立即安装按钮不可见）、closebtn 显示（否则关闭按钮可见性靠 XML 默认值巧合）。缺一个都会有 UI 错乱。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5q7ny2b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5q7ny2b","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么不调 SetFocus 到安装按钮？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-51g1xst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-51g1xst","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为 SetDownloadLayoutVisible 末尾有 install_button_-\u003eSetFocus()，但那是用户主动点\"立即更新\"后的场景。静默弹窗是自动弹出的，如果焦点落在\"立即安装\"上，用户正在打字时误按空格或回车就会立刻退出企微重装，叠加\"不做二次确认\"会放大误操作。所以新分支不调 SetFocus，把误操作风险降到最低。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-0tkui62","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-0tkui62","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么跳过既有的统计上报？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ezcf444","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ezcf444","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为蓝盾包的统计上报没有被屏蔽，ReportStatisticTask 的 DoExecute 没有包类型判断，照常落盘上传。复用 ShowUpdateWindow 会把内部包数据灌进现网 log_id 78502481 的 update_show 报表，污染现网\"建议升级弹窗曝光\"统计。所以用 package_ready 字段在宏内跳过上报，不额外引入 skip_statistic 字段。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-h40zegy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-h40zegy","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现网零影响是怎么保证的？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tvskuhp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tvskuhp","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"靠两层。第一层是编译期宏隔离：所有新增代码和对现有文件的改动都 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RDM_BUILD 包裹，非蓝盾包预处理后代码与改动前逐字节相同，产物不变、行为不变、上报数据不变。第二层是运行期开关：Debug 开关默认关闭，关闭时整链不生效，等价于没有这段代码。验收标准里明确要求\"现网包预处理后代码与改动前逐字节相同\"\"开关关闭时日志中无任何本功能的 CGI/下载/弹窗记录\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-823f3z6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-823f3z6","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-2u6ym34","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-2u6ym34","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 8：开发中遇到的棘手问题"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-joftasf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-joftasf","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后缀命名撞车（PiplineSilentUpdate.tmp 被误删）怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-pw2tl53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-pw2tl53","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自测时发现静默包重启后 8 秒内就被删掉。根因是初版命名 PiplineSilentUpdate.tmp 的末尾恰好以 Update.tmp 结尾，被 GetAllExistUpdatePackagePath(\"Update.tmp\") 的尾缀匹配（rfind + size 判断\"以 category 结尾\"）误判成普通包，被每次启动的 ResetAllUpdateState 删除。修复是把 Silent 移到 Update 之后变成 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp，末尾变成 Silent.tmp，与 Update.tmp 无尾缀包含关系。这个坑说明\"按后缀匹配隔离\"的前提是后缀不能有包含关系。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-4707a9h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-4707a9h","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下载地址用了流水线详情页 URL 怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tus3fac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tus3fac","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自测时发现下载器下载了 142 字节的文件，实际是 HTML 页面。根因是 ParseDevopsUpdateVerDate 解出的 url 是蓝盾流水线详情页地址，不是安装包下载地址。修复是按固定模板拼装下载地址，与手动链路 ConfigWindow::CheckUpdateFromPipelineOld 一致，并让 cst 基于最终下载 URL 计算。这个坑说明\"协议返回的 url 不一定是你要下载的东西\"，要看清字段语义。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-g4ogsbq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-g4ogsbq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"构造函数读 config 的 UB 怎么避免？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-8iuujot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-8iuujot","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"方案 review 阶段发现，如果把\"取检测周期\"的函数写进基类构造参数，会踩未定义行为——基类构造参数的求值早于 ServiceTask 基类子对象构造，此时 environment 还是未初始化的 unique_ptr，解引用随机地址。修复是构造传编译期常量，Debug 配置延后到 DoOnInterval 运行时读。这是 C++ 继承体系里\"基类构造期间不能访问派生类/成员\"的经典陷阱。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-pwc5e1g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-pwc5e1g","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CGI 失败导致定时器停摆怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-8e0fur4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-8e0fur4","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编码后 review 发现，CheckDevopsUpdata().then(...) 只覆盖 resolve 路径，CGI 失败走 reject 路径时 then 不触发，ScheduleNext 不执行，定时器不再续期，功能静默失效。修复是补 .onError 兜底，在 onError 里切回执行线程调 ScheduleNext。证据链三点闭合：then 返回 void 命中 thenImpl 的 part 3 重载只 set_then_handler；CheckDevopsUpdata 内部的 onError 只打日志不触达本任务；ScheduleNextPolling 是唯一续期入口。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-lfw7ozz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-lfw7ozz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"单例窗口被占用导致提醒丢失怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-yklllu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-yklllu6","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"TL 评审时提出，CLiveUpdateFrame 的 suggest_instance 单例被占用时，ShowUpdateWindow 只置顶旧窗口、不重建，导致本轮静默提醒弹不出来（时间戳已写 → 提醒丢失），用户误点旧窗口还会装成手动下载的跨线包。修复是弹窗前检测单例，被占用就 ::DestroyWindow 销毁后重建，用同步的 DestroyWindow 而非异步的 Close。这是\"单例复用窗口\"场景下的一个隐蔽坑。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-og9po64","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-og9po64","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResetAllUpdateState 会误删静默包怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-49v3m31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-49v3m31","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二轮 review 发现，如果把新包类别加入 ResetAllUpdateState 清理，会导致包每次启动被删——因为 CheckAndExecuteUpdate 在登录前无条件调用，对蓝盾包必然命中清理分支。这会让\"启动时提示已下载包\"\"已有同版本包跳过下载\"\"节流未过包保留\"三条设计全部失效。修复是推翻原方案，ResetAllUpdateState 一行不动，孤儿文件由周期任务按版本自行清理。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-3swnjfm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-3swnjfm","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"异步回调线程约束怎么处理？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-y8aeqp3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-y8aeqp3","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编码后发现，CheckDevopsUpdata 和 DownloadUpdatePackage 的异步回调都被框架固定投递到 UI 线程，而周期任务运行在执行线程，ScheduleNext 操作的 timer_ 绑定执行线程。如果回调里直接调 ScheduleNext 就是跨线程操作 timer，构成竞态。修复是照抄现网 IntervalAutoSilentUpgradeTask 的范式：回调里只取数据，然后 GetExecuteThread()-\u003ePostTask 切回执行线程处理，ScheduleNext 只在执行线程函数里调用。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-tbdw81v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tbdw81v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"max_files 数量兜底无法覆盖断续启动怎么解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-omf6zyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-omf6zyr","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"需求 review 时发现，spdlog 的 max_files 只在跨天 rotate 时按文件数量淘汰，用户断续启动时（磁盘上只有一个 8 天前的文件）rotate 后数量 \u003c 7 不删，过期文件滞留。修复是加第二层 TrimOldMainLogs：启动时按文件名日期删过期文件，专门覆盖断续启动场景。这是\"数量兜底\"和\"日期兜底\"双层设计的由来。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-g9h2y1x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-g9h2y1x","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-9a8mbkq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9a8mbkq","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"模块 9：总结与项目复盘"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-yrghhrd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-yrghhrd","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用一句话分别介绍这两个需求？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-044j6po","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-044j6po","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理需求是把壳进程的日志系统改成\"按日期严格保留 7 天 + 写入全链路异步化\"，并通过双层清理（max_files 数量兜底 + TrimOldMainLogs 日期兜底）覆盖断续启动场景，同时下线 Critical 独立文件。蓝盾包版本更新需求是给蓝盾流水线包补一条\"定时检测 + 静默下载 + 24h 节流弹窗\"的低打扰自动更新提醒通道，用双闸门保证现网零影响。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-wt0s4kf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-wt0s4kf","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理需求最有价值的设计是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-drqzfyf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-drqzfyf","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双层清理 + 全链路异步化。双层清理解决的是\"数量兜底无法覆盖断续启动\"这个真实场景，max_files 管数量、TrimOldMainLogs 管日期，各司其职。异步化解决的是\"日志 IO 拖慢业务线程\"的问题，async_logger 让业务线程只入队即返回，g_trim_thread 让启动清理不阻塞主线程，两条异步链路互不依赖。整个改造净变动不到 100 行，零新增文件，体现了最小改动原则。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-hcwv1c0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-hcwv1c0","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝盾包版本更新需求最有价值的设计是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5fsvdpu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5fsvdpu","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双闸门 + 独立包类别 + 节流对齐。双闸门（编译期宏 + 运行期开关）把现网风险降到零；独立包类别解决了静默下载与手动跨线下载互相删包、装错版本的冲突；节流对齐解决了检测周期和节流门槛的相位差，让弹窗间隔精确 24 小时。另外\"所有分支走 ScheduleNext 唯一出口\"保证了任务永不死亡，开关中途打开也能生效。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ioparqr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ioparqr","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最值得讲的难点是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-it53nej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-it53nej","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"最值得讲的是蓝盾包版本更新的周期任务设计，尤其是几个隐蔽的坑：构造函数读 config 的 UB、CGI 失败的 onError 兜底、异步回调的线程约束、FinishExecuting 导致任务死亡、单例窗口占用的提醒丢失。这些坑每一个都是真实踩过或 review 出来的，能体现对 C++ 继承体系、Promise 语义、异步线程模型、单例模式的深入理解。日志清理那边最值得讲的是双层清理的设计动机和异步化的并发安全论证。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-is4strb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-is4strb","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当前最大的风险或不足是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5s9dbhc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5s9dbhc","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理方面：async_logger 强杀时队列中未落盘日志会丢失，这是已接受的降级；g_trim_thread 是静态存储期非平凡对象，靠\"ShutdownLog 必调用 + join\"保证安全，异常路径下没有额外兜底。蓝盾包版本更新方面：suggest_instance 单例与手动检查更新共用，销毁旧窗口时如果旧窗口正在下载会中断该下载（概率极低、后果可恢复）；24 小时周期定时器实际很少触发（开发机每日重启），周期仅作长期不关机时的兜底。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-qz4d1r2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-qz4d1r2","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果重新设计会改什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-pw5o5c9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-pw5o5c9","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理方面，我会把 TrimOldMainLogs 的清理做成可测试的独立接口，方便单元测试直接构造过期文件验证；考虑用更明确的生命周期管理替代裸 std::thread。蓝盾包版本更新方面，我会把\"节流对齐\"\"闸门续期\"\"onError 兜底\"这些容易踩坑的逻辑抽象成基类能力，避免每个周期任务都重新实现一遍；把下载 URL 的拼装逻辑收敛到一个公共函数，减少手动链路和静默链路的重复。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ycpmt68","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ycpmt68","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"推荐怎么讲这两个需求的面试故事线？"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-rp2pxh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-rp2pxh2","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先讲背景和痛点，为什么蓝盾包需要自动更新、为什么日志会堆积；再讲整体方案，双闸门、5 个功能点、双层清理；然后展开一个完整流程，从启动检测到静默下载到节流弹窗，以及从 InitLog 到清理到异步落盘；接着讲几个重点难点，构造 UB、onError 兜底、线程约束、独立包类别、节流对齐、双层清理；最后讲测试和边界，26 个测试用例覆盖了功能/稳定/并发/异步/兼容/回归六个维度。核心是始终回答：为什么需要这个设计、它解决了什么问题、边界和降级在哪里。"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ahij4g7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ahij4g7","updated":"20260903125257"}},{"ID":"20260903125257-n7rz0gw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-n7rz0gw","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"附录：面试速查表"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-a38ci4k","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-a38ci4k","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志清理技术主线"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-j7p4pax","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 主题 | 关键技术 | 一句话回答 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 双层清理 | max_files=7 + TrimOldMainLogs | 数量兜底 + 日期兜底 |\n| 清理判据 | 文件名日期正则 | 无外部系统依赖 |\n| 清理时机 | 进程启动 InitLog 首步 | 强杀/断电的必然触发点 |\n| 清理执行 | g_trim_thread 后台线程 | 主线程不等待，ShutdownLog join |\n| 日志写入 | spdlog async_logger | 入队即返回，后台落盘 |\n| 溢出策略 | block | 宁可阻塞不丢日志 |\n| Critical 下线 | 保留枚举删独立 sink | 内容由主日志承载 |\n| 状态透出 | ShellStatusHub | 日志同步 push 到 Debug 窗口 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-j7p4pax","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主题"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键技术"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一句话回答"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双层清理"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"max_files=7 + TrimOldMainLogs"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数量兜底 + 日期兜底"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理判据"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文件名日期正则"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无外部系统依赖"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理时机"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"进程启动 InitLog 首步"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强杀/断电的必然触发点"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理执行"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"g_trim_thread 后台线程"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主线程不等待，ShutdownLog join"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志写入"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"spdlog async_logger"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"入队即返回，后台落盘"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"溢出策略"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"block"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宁可阻塞不丢日志"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Critical 下线"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"保留枚举删独立 sink"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内容由主日志承载"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"状态透出"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ShellStatusHub"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日志同步 push 到 Debug 窗口"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-rj2y3u0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-rj2y3u0","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"蓝盾包版本更新技术主线"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-gw1zzy3","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 主题 | 关键技术 | 一句话回答 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 双闸门 | #if RDM_BUILD + Debug 开关 | 编译期 + 运行期隔离 |\n| 周期任务 | IntervalTask + SetFirstIntervalTimeInSeconds(2) | 首检 2s，周期 24h |\n| 闸门校验 | 开关 + PipelineId 非空 + 非正式包 | 三项全满足才继续 |\n| 检测 | CGI 3502 + ParseDevopsUpdateVerDate | 只填 pipeline_id，只解析 verdata |\n| 下载 | 固定模板 URL + 独立包类别 | 详情页 URL 不可用 |\n| 节流 | 只节流弹窗 + ServerTime + 设备级持久化 | 检测/下载不受节流 |\n| 节流对齐 | ScheduleNext 提前对齐 | 消除 48h 相位差 |\n| 唯一出口 | ScheduleNext（禁 FinishExecuting） | 任务永不死亡 |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-gw1zzy3","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主题"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键技术"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一句话回答"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"双闸门"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RDM_BUILD + Debug 开关"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编译期 + 运行期隔离"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"周期任务"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IntervalTask + SetFirstIntervalTimeInSeconds(2)"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首检 2s，周期 24h"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"闸门校验"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"开关 + PipelineId 非空 + 非正式包"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三项全满足才继续"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"CGI 3502 + ParseDevopsUpdateVerDate"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只填 pipeline_id，只解析 verdata"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下载"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"固定模板 URL + 独立包类别"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详情页 URL 不可用"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节流"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只节流弹窗 + ServerTime + 设备级持久化"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"检测/下载不受节流"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"节流对齐"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ScheduleNext 提前对齐"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"消除 48h 相位差"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"唯一出口"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ScheduleNext（禁 FinishExecuting）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任务永不死亡"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-aezmuwm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-aezmuwm","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两个需求的关键决策速查"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-o9e2n9z","Type":"NodeTable","Data":"| 决策 | 结论 | 原因 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 生效范围 | 编译期宏 #if RDM_BUILD | 现网产物不含代码 |\n| 比对范围 | 只当前流水线 | 静默跨大版本跳线风险高 |\n| 包隔离 | 独立类别 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp | 与手动包互删/错装 |\n| 清理时机 | 任务内按版本自清 | ResetAllUpdateState 会每次启动删包 |\n| 弹窗单例 | 被占用先 DestroyWindow 重建 | 否则提醒丢失/装错包 |\n| 时间戳 | PostEvent 后立即写 | 宁可漏提醒不可重复骚扰 |\n| 构造参数 | 编译期常量 | 基类构造期访问成员是 UB |","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-o9e2n9z","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"决策"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"结论"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原因"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生效范围"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编译期宏 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"tag","TextMarkTextContent":"if"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RDM_BUILD"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"现网产物不含代码"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比对范围"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"只当前流水线"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"静默跨大版本跳线风险高"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"包隔离"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"独立类别 PiplineUpdateSilent.tmp"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"与手动包互删/错装"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"清理时机"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"任务内按版本自清"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ResetAllUpdateState 会每次启动删包"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"弹窗单例"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"被占用先 DestroyWindow 重建"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"否则提醒丢失/装错包"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"时间戳"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"PostEvent 后立即写"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"宁可漏提醒不可重复骚扰"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","TableAligns":[0,0,0],"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"构造参数"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"编译期常量"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"基类构造期访问成员是 UB"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-ti8ylzi","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-ti8ylzi","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"简历项目表述（严格对应当前需求）"}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-i8z7o65","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-i8z7o65","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-x20n4xz","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-x20n4xz","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-7pjjm48","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-7pjjm48","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"参与企业微信 Windows 端壳进程日志系统改造，设计并实现\"按日期严格保留 7 天\"的双层清理机制（spdlog max_files 数量兜底 + 启动扫盘按文件名日期删除），覆盖用户断续启动导致的日志堆积场景。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-zekj95f","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-zekj95f","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-e9xry1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-e9xry1b","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实现日志写入全链路异步化，基于 spdlog async_logger 让业务线程入队即返回，后台线程统一落盘，通过 block 溢出策略和 flush_on 降级语义保证日志不丢。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-5xk9ih1","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-5xk9ih1","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-tkrlssv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-tkrlssv","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下线 Critical 独立文件产出线路，保留枚举与宏、删除独立 sink，Critical 内容合入主日志并统一由 7 天清理覆盖。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-iltjqrd","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-iltjqrd","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-9s55uum","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-9s55uum","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设计并实现蓝盾包新版本自动提醒功能，基于 IntervalTask 周期任务串联检测、静默下载、节流弹窗，通过编译期宏 + 运行期 Debug 开关双闸门保证现网零影响。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-rkvld7v","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"-","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-rkvld7v","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260903125257-4oxo956","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-4oxo956","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实现静默更新安装包的独立文件类别与物理隔离，解决与手动跨流水线下载互删、错装版本的问题；通过节流对齐消除检测周期与弹窗门槛的相位差，使提醒间隔精确 24 小时。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260903125257-3dr4avc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260903125257-3dr4avc","updated":"20260903125257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要写项目没有证据支撑的内容，例如\"实现微服务高可用\"\"使用分布式缓存\"\"自研日志框架替代 spdlog\"等。"}]}]}